e  democratic future  but it's unfortunately comes without  surprise  and as far as the chemical weapons are  concerned if putin deploys a chemical  biological weapons  what effect would that have on the  dynamics of this conflict  well i think it would bring your  conflict to a level that uh uh clearly  putin has no interest in bringing which  will be essentially  the west especially the united states  would be urged to intervene because i  think this will be clearly crossing a  line that's been it's been actually uh  mentioned by the polish president but  also recently by uh president biden that  weapons of mass destruction did not have  any place in this conflict so i think  he has to this is signaling obviously  he's trying to scare us from intervening  and he's obviously trying to terrorize  the ukrainian population but using it  will for sure take that conflict to a  brand new level with devastating  consequences for putin himself  so you have to wonder why russia would  do this at all because  are their backs really against the wall  as biden would have it or could they  just not just mobilize you know the  might of their air force to try and  neutralize the fighters in ukraine  i i think they are running quickly out  of options the fact that a couple of  days ago allegedly they would have used  a kind of hypersonic weapon is another  sign that they are using the kind of  weapons or threatening to use a kind of  weapon that has first no place in this  conflict struggle does not really have  an operational purpose so i think it's  it's putting trying to show that he's  not running out of options twice in fact  uh if you look at the the attrition rate  the russian soldiers casualties uh he's  indeed running quickly out of options  but we should not also underestimate how  hard it is for the ukrainians to resist  uh mario paul is on the verge of falling  this would be huge symbolic uh uh kind  of um  negative uh uh sign for for the  ukrainian resistance so and b